  "prefLabel": "En 1018.13 Designated Representative",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1018.13 Designated Representative. An applicant may designate a representative to process an application on applicant’s behalf, and an interconnection customer may designate a representative to meet some or all of the interconnection customer’s responsibilities under the IA.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
